S = {'cc': 'VE', 'fam': 'Social', 'doc': '# Venezuela 2025: contribución especial para la protección de las pensiones (3000); IVSS, RPE, FAOV, INCES grade C\n\nSources (`ve/law/`, Gaceta Oficial copies from the Travieso Evans gazette archive, ARCHIVE_INDEX.tsv):\n* **Ley de Protección de las Pensiones de Seguridad Social frente al Bloqueo Imperialista** (G.O. 6.806 Ext., 8 May 2024,\n  in force on publication): **art. 6** the contribution falls on "personas jurídicas, así como cualesquiera otras\n  sociedades de personas ... de carácter privado"; **art. 7** "hasta el quince por ciento (15%) del total de los pagos\n  realizados por el contribuyente a las trabajadoras y trabajadores por concepto de salario y bonificaciones de carácter\n  no salarial", the base for each worker never below the "ingreso mínimo integral indexado", the President fixes the\n  percentage; **art. 10** deductible for ISLR; **art. 11** distinct from the IVSS contributions.\n* **Decreto 4.952** (G.O. 42.880, 16 May 2024) **art. 1**: "el nueve por ciento (9%) del total de los pagos realizados por\n  el contribuyente a las trabajadoras y trabajadores"; art. 2 exempts enterprises in the Registro Nacional de\n  Emprendimientos. No later decree changing the 9 % was found.\nBooked as 3000 (a levy on the payroll of private legal persons that gives the worker no entitlement). Charged at 9 % of\nthe whole wage (salary and non-salary bonuses: the canon has one wage figure), on a company\'s payroll and on each\nadult\'s wages (the employer is taken to be a private legal person). The floor of the ingreso mínimo integral per worker is\nnot applied. Not modelled (C row): IVSS employer contributions (Ley del Seguro Social, 9-11 % by risk class to 5 minimum\nwages), Régimen Prestacional de Empleo 2 %, FAOV 2 %, INCES 2 %: their texts are not held.\n\n**Pass 9 (2026-11-21):** FAOV read in the 2024 texto único of the Ley del Régimen Prestacional de Vivienda y Hábitat (G.O. 6.805 Ext.; archived `ve/law/go6805_lrpvh_2024.*`) art. 33: 3 % of the salario integral into the worker\'s individual savings account, two thirds by the employer. A compulsory saving credited to the worker (like Brazil\'s FGTS) is not a tax in the OECD classification: recorded as a cited non-tax row, not charged. IVSS, RPE and INCES stay C.', 'lean': 'def lpp : Contribution := { name := "Contribución especial para la protección de las pensiones", sched := Schedule.flat 900 }\n\ndef lppF : Family := employerFamily "3000 contribución especial (Ley de Protección de las Pensiones)" [lpp] "Ley de Protección de las Pensiones de Seguridad Social (G.O. 6.806 Ext., 2024) arts. 6, 7; Decreto 4.952 (G.O. 42.880, 2024) art. 1: 9 %" (oecd := .payroll) (level := .central)', 'families': '[lppF]', 'unsupported': [['g.household.adults.any (·.wages > 0) || g.entity == .company', 'pension-protection contribution 9 % on the whole wage, employer taken as a private legal person (public employers and registered emprendimientos are outside); per-worker floor (ingreso mínimo integral) not applied; IVSS, RPE and INCES employer contributions not modelled; FAOV 2 % is compulsory saving (outside tax)']], 'guards': ['lpp.amount 1000000 == 90000'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '3000', 'tax': 'Contribución especial para la protección de las pensiones (9 %)', 'statute': 'Ley de Protección de las Pensiones de Seguridad Social frente al Bloqueo Imperialista (G.O. 6.806 Ext., 8 May 2024) arts. 6, 7, 10, 11; Decreto 4.952 (G.O. 42.880, 16 May 2024) art. 1', 'dated': 'Decreto 4.952 in force from 16 May 2024 (no later rate decree found)', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P4', 'kernel_parts': ['employerFamily', 'Contribution'], 'unsupported': ['employer taken as a private legal person', 'per-worker floor not applied']}, {'oecd': '2200', 'tax': 'IVSS, Régimen Prestacional de Empleo and INCES (employer)', 'statute': 'Ley del Seguro Social; Ley del Régimen Prestacional de Empleo; Ley del INCES', 'grade': 'C', 'status': 'unsupported', 'package': 'P4', 'kernel_parts': [], 'tried': "the gazettes of these laws (2012-2015) are not in the gazette archive reached (it starts later); not held by the 1.x builder; pass 9: not in lexifina/venezuela-law; gacetaoficial.gob.ve 2024 gazettes reachable but these laws' texts (2012-2014) not found", 'unsupported': ['would unlock: the four laws as in force 2025 and the 2025 minimum wage for the IVSS/RPE ceilings']}, {'oecd': '2200', 'tax': "FAOV housing savings (employer 2/3 of 3 % of salario integral): compulsory saving credited to the worker's individual account, outside tax", 'statute': 'Ley del Régimen Prestacional de Vivienda y Hábitat (texto único, G.O. 6.805 Ext. of 2024) art. 33 num. 1: "El aporte mensual en la cuenta de cada trabajadora o trabajador equivalente al tres por ciento (3%) de su salario integral ... los aportes obligatorios de los patronos a la cuenta de cada trabajador, equivalente a dos tercios (2/3)"; art. 33 num. 5: the Ministry may raise it (not below 3 %)', 'dated': 'G.O. 6.805 Ext. (2024), gacetaoficial.gob.ve; pass 9, 2026-11-21', 'grade': 'A', 'status': 'not levied', 'package': 'P4', 'kernel_parts': ['Absent'], 'unsupported': ['Ministry resolutions changing the 3 % (art. 33 num. 5) not searched']}]}
